{#
   §6 The team — behavior floor + leaderboard + coaching cards.
   Reference: Sarreid PASS3 §6 (lines 134-168).

   Tier resolution (report_operator.md §5a.1):
     All tiers — behavioral floor (VM-R1/R2/R4) renders when data present; omit-not-stub when absent
     Tier 2    — full leaderboard (names) + top-5 coaching cards
     Tier 1    — leaderboard + coaching cards at rep-number grain
     Tier 0    — leaderboard suppressed; behavioral floor replaces suppression_commerce_none

   Rep behavior floor (VM-R1-R4, catalog Domain 12):
     R1 = activity & cadence (Q-R1, OWNED, always-on)
     R2 = coverage penetration (Q-R2, OWNED, always-on)
     R4 = quote-to-submit discipline (Q-R4, OWNED, always-on)
     R3 = Mixpanel-gated (not wired in this pass — fast-follow)

   Omit-not-stub: each leg guarded individually; if all legs absent,
   the "### Rep activity floor" heading is suppressed too. Use Jinja comments only.

   The heading dollar is availability.coaching_cards, NOT RepRisk.dollars_at_risk.
   The latter is the discount-leak proxy, so the heading disagreed with the cards
   directly beneath it (hfg: "$0.04M to coach against" above $446K/$231K/$164K).
   Same handle as the hero band and the cards themselves.

   Q-53 (unactivated accounts) renders after the coverage table: coverage says
   how many accounts are untouched, Q-53 names the biggest of them. It is read
   into the bundle BEFORE outreach_screen.apply — hfg's two largest are its own
   DTC webstores, which the profile screens.

   Two traps, both paid for: a comment placed between this block and a
   heading emits a newline and shifts every byte after it, and a comment
   whose TEXT contains a closing brace-hash ends the block early and dumps
   the remainder into the report. Keep notes here, and keep them free of
   Jinja delimiters.
#}
{% from '_macros.md.j2' import signal_rep_atrisk_book, action_rep_atrisk_book %}
## The team{% if availability.team %} — leaderboard · ${{ "{:,.2f}".format((availability.coaching_cards[:5] | sum(attribute='at_risk_ltm')) / 1_000_000) }}M to coach against{% else %} — activity floor{% endif %}

