{%- elif ra.dark_seats > 0 -%}
**{{ ra.dark_seats }} of {{ ra.active_seats }} seats have gone 90+ days without logging in.** {% if ra.dark_seats >= (ra.active_seats // 2) %}More than half the active seat base is dark — this is a systematic adoption gap, not individual scheduling.{% else %}These are your re-activation targets: the customer relationships and territory knowledge are there, the platform habit isn't yet.{% endif %}
{%- else -%}
