{% if gather.rep_risks -%}
{# Coaching cards are book-decay cards. WHICH reps get one, and WHICH of their
   accounts the card is about, is decided in signals.coaching_card_reps and
   handed here through `availability.coaching_cards` — see W3/S2. Two rules it
   carries that this template used to get wrong:
     - pure discount-leak reps (dollars_at_risk from leakage, accounts_at_risk==0)
       route to the discount-discipline note below, not to a "$XK across 0
       accounts" card (audit_cci §coaching-cards);
     - the account named on the card is one that `gather.account_needs_a_call`
       agrees has slipped — the fifth surface of Phase 4's single definition,
       not a sixth. Re-deriving either rule here is what produced a RISK card
       about a +6.7% account on hfg. #}
{% set _cards = availability.coaching_cards -%}
{% if _cards -%}
### Top-{{ [_cards | length, 5] | min }} rep{{ "s" if (_cards | length) != 1 else "" }} by the book at risk on their own territory

{% for _card in _cards[:5] %}
{% set c = _card.risk -%}
{# The badge states the AT-RISK BOOK — the LTM of this rep's accounts that
   have slipped — not RepRisk.dollars_at_risk, which is a discount-leak
   proxy. hfg showed "$22K at risk across 1 account" for a rep whose one
   flagged account was GROWING, while the rep carrying $446K across three
   real declines was not on the page. #}
> **Card {{ loop.index }} — {{ c.display_label or "—" }} · ${{ "{:,.0f}".format(_card.at_risk_ltm / 1000) }}K of book at risk across {{ _card.flagged_count }} account{{ "s" if _card.flagged_count != 1 else "" }}**
{% if coaching_narratives and coaching_narratives[loop.index0] -%}
<!--slot:C-->
> {{ coaching_narratives[loop.index0] }}
<!--/slot:C-->
{%- else -%}
{% if _card.account and (_card.account.bill_to_name or _card.account.bill_to_number) -%}
{% set acct = _card.account -%}
{% if acct.is_real_decline -%}
> {{ acct.bill_to_name or acct.bill_to_number }} is **${{ "{:,.0f}".format(acct.ltm_rev / 1000) }}K** LTM — down {{ "{:.0f}".format((1 - acct.recent_6mo / acct.prior_6mo) * 100) if acct.prior_6mo > 0 else "materially" }}% over six months, {{ acct.days_silent }} {{ plural(acct.days_silent, 'day') }} silent. {{ action_rep_atrisk_book(c, acct) }}
{%- elif acct.is_cadence_cliff or (acct.recent_vs_prior_pct is not none and acct.recent_vs_prior_pct > 0) -%}
> {{ acct.bill_to_name or acct.bill_to_number }} is **${{ "{:,.0f}".format(acct.ltm_rev / 1000) }}K** LTM — {{ acct.days_silent }} {{ plural(acct.days_silent, 'day') }} silent on a growing account ({{ "{:+.0f}".format(acct.recent_vs_prior_pct) }}% YoY). {{ action_rep_atrisk_book(c, acct) }}
{%- else -%}
> {{ acct.bill_to_name or acct.bill_to_number }} is **${{ "{:,.0f}".format(acct.ltm_rev / 1000) }}K** LTM — {{ acct.days_silent }} {{ plural(acct.days_silent, 'day') }} silent{% if acct.recent_vs_prior_pct is not none %} ({{ "{:+.0f}".format(acct.recent_vs_prior_pct) }}%){% endif %}. {{ action_rep_atrisk_book(c, acct) }}
{%- endif %}
{%- else -%}
> {{ signal_rep_atrisk_book(none, c) }}
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}

{% endfor %}
